### Worked example
Output:
```json
{"approach": "browser", "reason": "portal Y has no API",
 "patterns": ["pattern-3-resilience"],
 "components": [{"name": "login_and_open_form", "role": "navigate with the user's session"},
                {"name": "fill_and_submit", "role": "fill fields from the workbook, submit, capture receipt"}],
 "items": "one item per report section",
 "error_handling": {"max_retries": 3, "network_retry_wait_s": 60, "skip_on_data_error": false},
